url: "https://github.com/Erye932/stateprobe"
abstract: "StateProbe is a debugger for prompts and LLM behavior. It diagnoses prompt-induced behavior pressure across interpretable axes and separates static proxy evidence, black-box behavioral evidence, and local activation probing."
